# The Emissary Windurst at Giddeus, with an Aspir Knife and a Bronze Dagger in the bag. Uu Zhoumo at status 0: nothing
# from the mission, the zone default 44. A Bronze Dagger trade plays nothing. Status 4: 40, whose finish moves to
# status 5; status 5: 43; a Dull Sword is given, and the Aspir Knife trade plays 41, whose finish takes the knife and
# the Dull Sword and moves to status 6; at status 6 the mission's arm for 6 and up plays 44, the same event as the
# zone default (replay cannot tell them apart; a fake check pins it).
